## Graphical Abstract
A facile and highly efficient one pot synthesis method for $\mathbf{\boldsymbol{a}}$ –amylase MOF–sponge by rapid and straightforward method.
Highlights:
$\mathfrak{a}$ –Amylase embedded ZIF-67 fabricated onto melamine sponge by rapid and straightforward method. ► $\mathfrak{a}$ –Amylase MOF–sponge was analyzed and characterized by FT–IR, XRD, SEM and TGA. ►The melamine sponge didn’t limit mass transfer of substrate even after coating of amylase MOF on it. $\blacktriangleright$ In reusability of $\mathfrak{a}$ –Amylase MOF–sponge, $32\%$ residual activity was retained after six cycles.
